          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>We will reject the alternative hypothesis $H_{1}:p\\neq p_{0}$ when ________<br/><br/>(i) $|z_{0}|<z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(ii) $z_{0}>-z_{\\alpha/2}$ or $z_{0}<z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(iii) $p_{0}>|p_{\\alpha/2}|$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Ta sẽ BÁC BỎ đối thuyết $H_{1}:p\\neq p_{0}$ khi ________<br/><br/>(i) $|z_{0}|<z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(ii) $z_{0}>-z_{\\alpha/2}$ hoặc $z_{0}<z_{\\alpha/2}$<br/>(iii) $p_{0}>|p_{\\alpha/2}|$</p></div>",
